{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-driven-scaling","title":"指标驱动伸缩：选择正确的伸缩信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling/metrics-driven-scaling","wordCount":1622,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"指标驱动伸缩-选择正确的伸缩信号\">指标驱动伸缩：选择正确的伸缩信号</h1><p>自动伸缩的核心挑战不是技术实现，而是<strong>选择什么指标来触发伸缩</strong>。错误的指标会导致两类问题：扩容过晚（用户已经体验到性能下降）或缩容过激（刚缩完又需要扩）。本文系统梳理各类指标的适用场景、选择方法论和常见陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指标层次</td>\n<td>从系统到业务的四层：系统指标（CPU/内存）→ 运行时 → 应用（QPS/延迟）→ 业务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QPS / RPS</td>\n<td>每秒请求数，最直接反映服务负载的应用层指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P99 延迟</td>\n<td>99% 的请求在该时间内完成，最接近用户体验的指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列深度</td>\n<td>消息积压量，异步消费者服务的最佳伸缩指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标追踪</td>\n<td>通过调整副本数，维持某指标在目标值附近的伸缩策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KEDA</td>\n<td>Kubernetes Event-Driven Autoscaling，支持 50+ 种外部指标触发 HPA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标的分类体系\">指标的分类体系</h2><p>自动伸缩可用的指标分为四个层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 指标层次&#10;        A[&quot;业务指标(最接近用户体验)\\n活跃用户数 / 订单率 / 支付成功率&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;应用指标(服务性能)\\nQPS / P99 延迟 / 错误率 / 队列深度&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;运行时指标(进程级)\\nGC 频率 / 连接池使用率 / 线程数&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;系统指标(最基础)\\nCPU 利用率 / 内存 / 网络带宽 / 磁盘 I/O&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B --&gt; C --&gt; D&#10;&#10;    note1[&quot;越靠近用户体验,延迟越低\\n越靠近系统,采集越简单&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 指标层次\n        A[\"业务指标(最接近用户体验)\\n活跃用户数 / 订单率 / 支付成功率\"]\n        B[\"应用指标(服务性能)\\nQPS / P99 延迟 / 错误率 / 队列深度\"]\n        C[\"运行时指标(进程级)\\nGC 频率 / 连接池使用率 / 线程数\"]\n        D[\"系统指标(最基础)\\nCPU 利用率 / 内存 / 网络带宽 / 磁盘 I/O\"]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B --&gt; C --&gt; D\n\n    note1[\"越靠近用户体验,延迟越低\\n越靠近系统,采集越简单\"]</pre><p><strong>选择指标的核心原则</strong>：尽量选择<strong>最直接反映用户体验的指标</strong>，只有当业务/应用指标不可用时才回退到系统指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-与内存-最常用但最容易误用\">CPU 与内存：最常用但最容易误用</h2><h3 id=\"cpu-利用率\">CPU 利用率</h3><p>CPU 是最直观、采集最简单的系统指标，也是最容易被误用的。</p>\n<p><strong>适合用 CPU 触发伸缩的场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU 密集型服务：视频转码、图像处理、加密运算、机器学习推理</li>\n<li>有明确 CPU-吞吐量相关性的服务</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>CPU 指标的问题</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滞后性</td>\n<td>CPU 高是&quot;已经过载&quot;的结果，不是预警信号</td>\n<td>用 QPS 或队列深度提前触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非线性</td>\n<td>某些服务 CPU 50% 时延迟就已激增</td>\n<td>用延迟指标更直接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I/O 绑定服务不适用</td>\n<td>数据库查询 90% 时间等 I/O，CPU 很低但响应慢</td>\n<td>用 P99 延迟或队列等待时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>正确配置 CPU 目标追踪</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kubernetes HPA 以 CPU 为目标追踪（目标 70%，不是 80%+）&#10;apiVersion: autoscaling/v2&#10;kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-service&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;    kind: Deployment&#10;    name: my-service&#10;  minReplicas: 2&#10;  maxReplicas: 20&#10;  metrics:&#10;    - type: Resource&#10;      resource:&#10;        name: cpu&#10;        target:&#10;          type: Utilization&#10;          averageUtilization: 70 # 保留 30% headroom\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kubernetes HPA 以 CPU 为目标追踪（目标 70%，不是 80%+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">autoscaling/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HorizontalPodAutoscaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scaleTargetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  minReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  maxReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Resource</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cpu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Utilization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          averageUtilization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 保留 30% headroom</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"内存利用率\">内存利用率</h3><p>内存伸缩比 CPU 更复杂，因为内存的使用模式更多样化：</p>\n<p><strong>内存指标的挑战</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>内存泄漏伪装成高使用率</strong>：持续增长的内存不是负载增加，是 bug</li>\n<li><strong>JVM 内存管理</strong>：JVM 会尽量用满分配的内存，GC 后才释放，导致内存利用率常年偏高</li>\n<li><strong>缩容风险</strong>：内存不像 CPU 会&quot;归零&quot;，缩容可能导致内存压力转移</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>内存适合触发伸缩的场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>缓存服务：内存使用量直接对应缓存命中率</li>\n<li>数据处理服务：内存使用量与处理数据量正相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不推荐用内存触发伸缩的场景</strong>：JVM 应用（GC 行为导致误判）、有内存泄漏风险的服务（应修复 bug 而非扩容）</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用层指标-更接近用户体验\">应用层指标：更接近用户体验</h2><h3 id=\"qps-rps-每秒请求数\">QPS / RPS（每秒请求数）</h3><p>QPS 是最直接反映服务负载的指标之一。与 CPU 不同，QPS 变化先于 CPU 变化（请求进来→CPU 才开始处理）。</p>\n<p><strong>QPS 触发伸缩的配置</strong>（使用 Prometheus + KEDA）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# KEDA ScaledObject 使用 Prometheus 自定义指标&#10;apiVersion: keda.sh/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ScaledObject&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: http-requests-scaler&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    name: my-service&#10;  minReplicaCount: 2&#10;  maxReplicaCount: 50&#10;  triggers:&#10;    - type: prometheus&#10;      metadata:&#10;        serverAddress: http://prometheus:9090&#10;        metricName: http_requests_per_second&#10;        query: sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=&quot;my-service&quot;}[1m]))&#10;        threshold: &#39;1000&#39; # 每个副本目标承载 1000 QPS\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># KEDA ScaledObject 使用 Prometheus 自定义指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">keda.sh/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ScaledObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http-requests-scaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scaleTargetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  minReplicaCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  maxReplicaCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  triggers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        serverAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://prometheus:9090</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        metricName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http_requests_per_second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=\"my-service\"}[1m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每个副本目标承载 1000 QPS</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>QPS 伸缩的计算逻辑</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"目标副本数 = ceil(当前 QPS / 每副本目标 QPS)&#10;&#10;示例：当前 QPS = 5000，每副本目标 = 1000&#10;目标副本数 = ceil(5000/1000) = 5 个副本\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>目标副本数 = ceil(当前 QPS / 每副本目标 QPS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例：当前 QPS = 5000，每副本目标 = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>目标副本数 = ceil(5000/1000) = 5 个副本</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"p99-延迟-最接近用户体验\">P99 延迟：最接近用户体验</h3><p><strong>延迟（特别是 P99/P999）是用户实际感受到的服务质量</strong>，是最有意义的伸缩指标。</p>\n<p><strong>延迟指标的采集</strong>（需要服务暴露 Histogram 或 Summary 类型的 Prometheus 指标）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prometheus\" data-code=\"# 查询 P99 延迟（需要 histogram_quantile 函数）&#10;histogram_quantile(0.99,&#10;  sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=&quot;my-service&quot;}[5m]))&#10;  by (le)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 查询 P99 延迟（需要 histogram_quantile 函数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>histogram_quantile(0.99,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"my-service\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  by (le)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>延迟触发伸缩的阈值设定</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"SLA 要求：P99 ≤ 200ms&#10;告警阈值：P99 &gt; 150ms（预留 25% 缓冲让扩容有时间生效）&#10;伸缩触发：P99 &gt; 150ms 持续 2 分钟\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SLA 要求：P99 ≤ 200ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>告警阈值：P99 > 150ms（预留 25% 缓冲让扩容有时间生效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>伸缩触发：P99 > 150ms 持续 2 分钟</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：延迟指标的采集和聚合有延迟（通常 1~5 分钟），因此延迟触发的伸缩比 QPS 触发略慢。最佳实践是两者结合：QPS 触发快速扩容，延迟触发作为兜底验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"错误率-质量退化的信号\">错误率：质量退化的信号</h3><p>错误率升高不总是容量问题（也可能是代码 bug 或依赖故障），但在确认容量相关时，错误率是有效的伸缩信号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prometheus\" data-code=\"# 错误率（5xx 响应比例）&#10;sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~&quot;5..&quot;}[1m]))&#10;/ sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m]))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 错误率（5xx 响应比例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/ sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m]))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>错误率与容量的关联性判断</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>错误率上升 + QPS 上升 → 容量问题，触发扩容</li>\n<li>错误率上升 + QPS 稳定 → 非容量问题，触发告警不扩容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"队列深度-异步系统的关键指标\">队列深度：异步系统的关键指标</h2><p>对于消息队列消费者（Kafka Consumer、SQS Worker），队列积压深度是最自然的伸缩指标：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[生产者] --&gt; Q[消息队列\\n深度=积压量]&#10;    Q --&gt; C1[消费者 1]&#10;    Q --&gt; C2[消费者 2]&#10;    Q --&gt; C3[消费者 N]&#10;&#10;    Monitor[监控队列深度] --&gt; Scale[触发伸缩\\n深度&gt;阈值 → 增加消费者]\">flowchart LR\n    P[生产者] --&gt; Q[消息队列\\n深度=积压量]\n    Q --&gt; C1[消费者 1]\n    Q --&gt; C2[消费者 2]\n    Q --&gt; C3[消费者 N]\n\n    Monitor[监控队列深度] --&gt; Scale[触发伸缩\\n深度&gt;阈值 → 增加消费者]</pre><p><strong>KEDA Kafka 触发器配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"triggers:&#10;  - type: kafka&#10;    metadata:&#10;      bootstrapServers: kafka:9092&#10;      consumerGroup: my-consumer-group&#10;      topic: my-topic&#10;      lagThreshold: &#39;100&#39; # 每个副本目标积压量&#10;      offsetResetPolicy: latest\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">triggers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      bootstrapServers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka:9092</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      consumerGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-consumer-group</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-topic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      lagThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每个副本目标积压量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      offsetResetPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latest</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>计算逻辑</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"目标副本数 = ceil(当前积压量 / 每副本目标积压)&#10;&#10;示例：积压 500 条消息，每副本目标 = 100 条&#10;目标副本数 = ceil(500/100) = 5 个消费者实例\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>目标副本数 = ceil(当前积压量 / 每副本目标积压)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>示例：积压 500 条消息，每副本目标 = 100 条</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>目标副本数 = ceil(500/100) = 5 个消费者实例</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自定义业务指标\">自定义业务指标</h2><p>对于特定业务，标准系统指标可能完全无法反映实际压力。这时需要暴露<strong>自定义业务指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务类型</th>\n<th>自定义指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>游戏服务器</td>\n<td>在线玩家数 / 房间数</td>\n<td>每个实例有容量上限（如最多 100 个玩家）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频转码</td>\n<td>待转码任务数</td>\n<td>直接反映处理压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索服务</td>\n<td>搜索请求延迟 × QPS</td>\n<td>组合指标，反映整体负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 推理</td>\n<td>GPU 利用率</td>\n<td>CPU 很低但 GPU 是瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>暴露自定义 Prometheus 指标（Go 示例）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var activeGameRooms = prometheus.NewGauge(prometheus.GaugeOpts{&#10;    Name: &quot;game_active_rooms_total&quot;,&#10;    Help: &quot;Current number of active game rooms&quot;,&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 每个实例目标承载 50 个房间&#10;// KEDA 中设置 threshold=50\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activeGameRooms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prometheus.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewGauge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GaugeOpts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"game_active_rooms_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Help: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Current number of active game rooms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每个实例目标承载 50 个房间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// KEDA 中设置 threshold=50</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多指标组合策略\">多指标组合策略</h2><p>单一指标的局限性可以通过<strong>多指标组合</strong>来弥补：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# HPA 多指标配置（任意一个指标触发都会导致扩容）&#10;metrics:&#10;  - type: Resource&#10;    resource:&#10;      name: cpu&#10;      target:&#10;        type: Utilization&#10;        averageUtilization: 70&#10;  - type: Pods&#10;    pods:&#10;      metric:&#10;        name: http_requests_per_second&#10;      target:&#10;        type: AverageValue&#10;        averageValue: &#39;1000&#39;&#10;  - type: External&#10;    external:&#10;      metric:&#10;        name: p99_latency_ms&#10;      target:&#10;        type: AverageValue&#10;        averageValue: &#39;150&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># HPA 多指标配置（任意一个指标触发都会导致扩容）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Resource</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cpu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Utilization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        averageUtilization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http_requests_per_second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AverageValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        averageValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1000'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">External</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    external</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">p99_latency_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AverageValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        averageValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'150'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多指标的决策规则</strong>：HPA 取所有指标中<strong>计算出的最大副本数</strong>，确保任一资源成为瓶颈时都能及时扩容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标选择速查\">指标选择速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务类型</th>\n<th>首选指标</th>\n<th>次选指标</th>\n<th>不推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU 密集型（转码、加密）</td>\n<td>CPU 利用率</td>\n<td>QPS</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web API 服务</td>\n<td>QPS + P99 延迟</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>原始内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库（读副本）</td>\n<td>P99 查询延迟</td>\n<td>连接数</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存服务（Redis）</td>\n<td>内存使用率 + QPS</td>\n<td>命中率</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列消费者</td>\n<td>队列积压深度</td>\n<td>消费延迟</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>游戏服务器</td>\n<td>在线连接数</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 推理服务</td>\n<td>GPU 利用率 + 请求队列</td>\n<td>P99 延迟</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>指标选择遵循&quot;最接近用户体验优先&quot;的原则：QPS + P99 延迟组合是 Web API 服务的首选，队列深度是消费者服务的首选，CPU 利用率仅适用于真正 CPU 密集型的服务。多指标组合（HPA 取最大副本数）可以弥补单一指标的局限。对于特殊业务（游戏、AI 推理），需要暴露自定义业务指标（在线连接数、GPU 利用率），而不是强行使用不相关的系统指标触发伸缩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"horizontal-vertical-scaling\">水平与垂直伸缩</a>——指标触发的伸缩方向选择</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"predictive-scaling\">预测式伸缩</a>——从响应式指标驱动进化到预测式提前扩容</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"指标驱动伸缩：选择正确的伸缩信号","id":"指标驱动伸缩-选择正确的伸缩信号"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指标的分类体系","id":"指标的分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU 与内存：最常用但最容易误用","id":"cpu-与内存-最常用但最容易误用"},{"level":3,"text":"CPU 利用率","id":"cpu-利用率"},{"level":3,"text":"内存利用率","id":"内存利用率"},{"level":2,"text":"应用层指标：更接近用户体验","id":"应用层指标-更接近用户体验"},{"level":3,"text":"QPS / RPS（每秒请求数）","id":"qps-rps-每秒请求数"},{"level":3,"text":"P99 延迟：最接近用户体验","id":"p99-延迟-最接近用户体验"},{"level":3,"text":"错误率：质量退化的信号","id":"错误率-质量退化的信号"},{"level":2,"text":"队列深度：异步系统的关键指标","id":"队列深度-异步系统的关键指标"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义业务指标","id":"自定义业务指标"},{"level":2,"text":"多指标组合策略","id":"多指标组合策略"},{"level":2,"text":"指标选择速查","id":"指标选择速查"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"水平与垂直伸缩：选择维度与有状态服务扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling/horizontal-vertical-scaling"},"next":{"title":"预测式伸缩：提前扩容，消除响应滞后","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling/predictive-scaling"}}